{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "bcea6ced-942b-5c81-a034-f05bdb371ea9", "source_ordinal": 2736, "reading_ordinal": 1317, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "四步一没有", "published_at": "2022-06-21T01:14:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/522141575/answer/2537553385"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "依次默想几件事：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）要给ta说清楚，得现场教ta 语言学 / 逻辑学 / 数学 / 经济学 / 化学 / 物理学 / 军事学 /……", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 67}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "Which is 少说得几个月甚至几年学的课程。", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）ta不会买单，还会抬杠、会补弱、会提各种不着调的“反驳”，还要把各种该自己用的功夫推在你身上，比如要你“提供证据”。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "加倍的劳动量。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "3）幸好ta跟你没有什么明文的契约关系和利益牵扯，对你的影响非常间接。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "4）其实趁年轻受点挫折没啥不好。没有挫折，怎么成熟呢？", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "走完这四步，", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 233}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你就没有这冲动了。", "char_start": 234, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "—————冲动的分割线——————", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "走完这四步，你还是决定要说的，", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "就不是出于冲动了。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 289}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何克制辩驳的冲动?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“四步一没有”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“依次默想几件事：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "依次默想几件事：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5a334348-46e8-512e-9225-32415ff56897", "source_ordinal": 2735, "reading_ordinal": 1318, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "地气", "published_at": "2022-06-21T02:16:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/20003863/answer/2537578636"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "接地气的意思，是让自认为社会地位比较低的人容易赞同你的主张。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如，你有一款产品，希望收入不高的人也会购买，你为此所做的一系列的设计和修改，就叫做“接地气”。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "颇有一种“山不来接近穆罕默德，穆罕穆德就向山走去”的意思。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不过呢，这件事有正有邪。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "所谓的正，降低的是沟通门槛，只需要你听明白，以便让你有机会真正的赞成或者反对。这样的人并不寻求你赞同ta的诉求，只是为了让你多点信息，让你多一些新的变数、转机、选择。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "换言之，只寻求更低的理解门槛，不寻求你的认同。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所谓的邪，降低的是成交门槛，它根本不追求让你明白，而是兜售一种良好的自我感觉、一种获得感，以此交换你对ta进行有效的支付，买点什么或者送ta什么可卖可以换钱的东西，或者换你赞同ta在积攒的东西。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是一种相互的贿赂。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "从前者到后者，其实还有额外的一里地（extra mile）要走。它时常拷问“接地气”的人——你要不要盈利？或者更严厉的——你要不要保本？", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一旦你要保本，为了保本，你就要再多走一里地。", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 433}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而多走了一里地，你的成本更高了，你这一里地会往哪边走？", "char_start": 434, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这一里地本来就是为了“至少保本”走的，它能往哪里走？", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 488}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "它的目的不会再是“降低理解门槛”，而只会是“降低付款门槛”了。", "char_start": 489, "char_end": 520}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "悲剧的是——恰恰是后者，常常被它的受害者们盛赞接地气。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而讽刺在于——如果ta们索性高居庙堂，不与这些自觉被亏欠者发生交集，说的话让后者一望便知门槛高峻、代价高昂，反而没人会去想到接不接地气这个层面。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "恰恰是ta们降低了理解成本，使得一些复杂而关键的议题的探讨资格门槛下降到了受众可以企及的程度，反而会因为这些问题的复杂和艰难令受众焦虑不安，从而受到惩罚和报复。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 703}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这种惩罚和报复，最典型的一种，就是心知对方想要接近自己，故意宣布对方的接近失败。", "char_start": 704, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "“你不接地气。”", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 753}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你不会因为做了接地气的努力，就得到接地气的评价。", "char_start": 755, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你为接地气所做的努力、所花费的成本，只要你不肯多走那一里地，在净收益期望上会是一种损害，而无法转化为“接地气”的人们那样令人眼馋的收益。", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 848}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "它的净效果，反而是会让很多原本伤害不到你的人，有机会而且有动机伤害你——尤其是你的技术不够成熟、思考不够完整时，更是必然。", "char_start": 849, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "事情就是这样安排的，这不是什么人的阴谋，而就是这个世界的客观运行规则。你要这么做，你要面对的就是这个结果。技巧只会降低你的损失，不会改变“多走一里路会赚得更多”的事实。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 995}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "要做接地气的努力，但是不要指望接地气的评价。", "char_start": 996, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你很清楚地知道你做了接地气的努力，那么你要把“时不时有人因未被贿赂而责骂你不接地气”视为一种健康而积极的信号。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1074}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为总会有人默认“既然做出行贿的低姿态，想来必有打点”，从而被“居然没有打点”激怒，认为你没有“照足规矩”。", "char_start": 1075, "char_end": 1129}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这“愤怒”来得正好，因为ta是你没有走那一里路的证据。", "char_start": 1130, "char_end": 1157}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不服的，就是这规矩。", "char_start": 1159, "char_end": 1169}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "F*ck your “规矩”。", "char_start": 1170, "char_end": 1185}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "我才是规矩。", "char_start": 1187, "char_end": 1193}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 35}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：当我们谈论「接地气」时我们在谈论什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“地气”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“接地气的意思，是让自认为社会地位比较低的人容易赞同你的主张。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "接地气的意思，是让自认为社会地位比较低的人容易赞同你的主张。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "dd7fcf4a-cd69-5c01-ac59-013e264561a1", "source_ordinal": 2734, "reading_ordinal": 1319, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "枝头雀", "published_at": "2022-06-21T19:04:59+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/39459235/answer/2538673790"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "坦白说，“底层人”接触到上层社会的机会不大。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一般人想象的都是所谓“麻雀飞上枝头”，就是借由恋爱关系突然进入上层社会。实际上能做到这一点的几乎没有所谓的“底层人物”，而只是自认为底层的中产阶层、市民阶级。真正的社会底层和上层社会发生直接友情和直接姻缘在秩序稳定的时代发生的概率极低，基本没有借鉴意义。只有在社会动荡时才会有一些类似王子落难记之类的机缘巧合才会造成一些这种状况。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 188}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "真正发生这种情况的现实可其实是发生在保安、清洁工、服务员、维修师傅身上。", "char_start": 189, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而这其实也只是中国的富裕阶层还很不成熟，自我保护还不够严密的初级阶段的暂时现象而已。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一旦成熟了，直接与上层社会接触的服务业其实自然而然的会有一些准入资格。给予的待遇也很容易使服务者脱离社会底层、进入中产阶层。以至于上层社会几乎不会与底层直接接触。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "直接与上层接触的贴身保镖、保安主管、服务主管、司机、厨师、贴身仆人、管家其实自己已经是中产阶层了，并非底层人。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta们也不会受到多大的冲击——毕竟已经习以为常。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以老实说，这其实是个问错了的问题。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "觉得会受到很大冲击的主要是中产阶层里生活圈子离上层社会比较远的那一部分。这部分中产阶层经常自认为是底层，其实只是自觉很弱势，无权无钱，所以心理上比较执着而已。", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "真正的衣食无着的底层人甚至都不关心这个问题，根本就不指望和上层社会发生什么关系，ta们甚至没有什么兴趣去关心这个问题。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 590}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "至于下中产会受到什么震撼，一般来说无非是两条——", "char_start": 591, "char_end": 615}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一个是条件多么好，生活多么奢华，简直像神一样的快活，钱和资源能避免多少纠结和恐惧。", "char_start": 616, "char_end": 657}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "一个是条件如此的好，生活如此的奢华，却还有人一样的痛苦，原来钱和资源也解决不了这么基本的纠结和恐惧。", "char_start": 658, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "两者兼有，密不可分。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 719}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：底层人接触到上层社会的生活对一个人的三观震撼有多大？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“枝头雀”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“坦白说，“底层人”接触到上层社会的机会不大。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "坦白说，“底层人”接触到上层社会的机会不大。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "02b905db-f897-5f58-89a0-8cf878a85d91", "source_ordinal": 2733, "reading_ordinal": 1320, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "失业率高", "published_at": "2022-06-21T19:24:57+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/533260345/answer/2538697233"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "失业率其实和“年轻人“没有多大关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "东亚社会里对劳动意愿的担忧基本上是多余的，因为除了拥有存量财富的人之外，基本上在东亚社会里一个人的人格尊严是和劳动价值绑定的。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很遗憾，东亚社会没有什么“尊重”的政治正确，它是赤裸裸的“不尊重”没有劳动价值的人的。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "实际上，西方世界也一样，只是ta们善于用“how can I help ya”的美好词汇包装起来，然后用“credit card or check”来成交，然后用“security!”来避免尴尬的场面罢了。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不尊重你的是security和police，又不是我。ta们有ta们的职责，你为什么要责怪ta们？", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我一直都是很nice的，你干嘛生气？", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你没钱可以睡大街，没饭可以去翻超市垃圾桶，病了可以死在桥洞下，不必担心，自然有市政的人帮你处理火化。", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "大家都很nice，多好。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "东亚社会可没这么nice，爹妈、配偶、朋友、亲戚，一边椎心泣血的掏钱养你，一边咬牙切齿的往死里骂你。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "或者并不掏钱养你，但总之这个来自所有关系人的、不自觉的全方位施压的习俗不再给个一百年，大概是改不了。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以，尽管年轻人们喊着躺平、摆烂，其实最多自欺欺人一段时间，最终总是扛不住这些绑定在劳动价值上的全面压力的。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以，就业率低在东亚根本就不存在就业意愿的问题，问题总是出在创造就业机会上。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "失业率高的真正问题在于创造不出足够的就业机会，不在于“年轻人摆烂”。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但这个创造不出足够的就业机会，远没有看上去这么简单。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "其实要实现充分就业，有两条康庄大道——", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "一条是启动一条人类无论如何都不可能完全满足的宏伟事业。星辰大海也罢、绿化沙漠也罢、移山填海也罢，哪有做得完的事业？哪有所谓“人手多余”这一说？", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 714}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "一条是把“多余的人”组织起来，建一支军队，对外发动战争。打赢了，战争收获自然养活这些人口；打输了，多余人口自然湮灭。", "char_start": 715, "char_end": 773}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "问题微妙之处在于，第一条路其实只有毫无外部威胁的天下共主可以走。除了有绝对安全实力的天下共主，任何其他人发动这样的伟大事业都要当心它不能快速的兑现为现实的生产力和军事实力。只有绝对的安全，才能不惧怕这类宏伟工程踏空的后果，放心大胆的依靠这类工程实现充分就业。", "char_start": 774, "char_end": 903}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这也往往是帝国霸业初成，威加四海，“征服了人类一切已知的边疆”，自然而然会做的动作。又是建新都，又是开运河，又是金字塔，又是大神庙。", "char_start": 904, "char_end": 970}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这其实并非简单的“好大喜功”，而是一种实现充分就业以保证社会秩序的稳定和谐的自然选择。", "char_start": 971, "char_end": 1014}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "问题是，现在的世界霸主——美国——并没有这样的智慧。", "char_start": 1015, "char_end": 1041}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "为什么没有，其实这跟资本主义意识形态内嵌的短视本性和资本主义对经济危机隐秘的内心渴望有关。其实经济危机对资本主义不是威胁，而是生存保障和收割季节，正因如此，资本主义国家的经济危机才会成为所谓的“痼疾”。", "char_start": 1042, "char_end": 1143}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "其实从根上说，每一次经济危机都是资本集团以极其廉价的成本大幅掠夺中下阶层的美好季节，所以ta们作为统治者，只会煞有介事的装模作样的“抵御通胀”。其实在这番装模作样的手舞足蹈的努力表演之下，ta们唯恐真的把这美好的盛宴搅和了。", "char_start": 1144, "char_end": 1256}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "劳动了十几年，就等这一顿好好开席，“避免”？", "char_start": 1257, "char_end": 1279}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "能“避免”才叫有鬼。", "char_start": 1280, "char_end": 1290}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "但这个说下去就深了。", "char_start": 1291, "char_end": 1301}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "美国其实本来可以作为世界共主，发起某种世界议程，带领整个人类实现充分就业，顺便型塑整个人类的文化体系的。", "char_start": 1302, "char_end": 1354}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "但历史的现实是——它没有这样做，而是选择了放任——甚至诱导整个世界一次又一次的陷入对它有利的危机。", "char_start": 1355, "char_end": 1404}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这还不是整个故事。", "char_start": 1405, "char_end": 1414}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "毫不客气的讲，世界上任何一个国家出现大规模失业，首先都是因为这个国家没有去走自己的“星辰大海之路”的结果。", "char_start": 1415, "char_end": 1468}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "没有的原因无非两个——第一个是处境不安全想走走不起，第二个是自己的统治集团出于私利欢迎危机。", "char_start": 1469, "char_end": 1515}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "社会主义国家主要是一，而资本主义国家主要是二。", "char_start": 1516, "char_end": 1539}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这时候就看出人类为什么一定要努力走向社会主义了——因为当资本主义国家主导国际秩序，它们首先对自己的危机就暗自欢喜，还会通过剥夺以社会主义为主体的国家的安全感，堵死前者的第一道路，以便不停的制造世界危机，从中牟利。", "char_start": 1540, "char_end": 1646}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "它们的一切“治理”在这个从心底里生长出的贪婪笼罩下，最终总是会沦为逼真然而无用的表演。", "char_start": 1647, "char_end": 1690}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "逼真绝对要逼真，头上要有汗，眼里要含泪，口里要喘息，要逼真到没人忍心责怪，", "char_start": 1691, "char_end": 1728}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "但表演也一定要是表演，万万不能假戏真做，真的力挽了狂澜。", "char_start": 1729, "char_end": 1757}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "要的就是狂澜，没有狂澜，哪有饥荒？没有饥荒，哪有一块饼换个黄花大闺女的好事？", "char_start": 1758, "char_end": 1796}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "这是个极其幽深晦暗、但却极其根本的道德问题。", "char_start": 1798, "char_end": 1820}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "不打破资本主义意识形态对世界的统治，人类是不可能摆脱失业的诅咒的。因为解决它最好的道路被它们堵死了，不但自己不走，而且也不准人走好走的路。", "char_start": 1821, "char_end": 1890}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "而不好的道路——战争，没人真的愿意走。", "char_start": 1892, "char_end": 1911}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "所有国家对抗失业的所有努力，都是在这个背景下、在这个统治逻辑所划定的基线上努力修正罢了。", "char_start": 1912, "char_end": 1956}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "所求者，不过是“不幸中之万幸”而已。", "char_start": 1957, "char_end": 1975}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "只能说，希望这样的时代能早点结束。", "char_start": 1977, "char_end": 1994}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 47}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：失业率 18.2% 创新高，年轻人「摆烂」为社会敲响警钟，你怎么看待摆烂行为？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "围绕“失业率高”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“失业率其实和“年轻人“没有多大关系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "失业率其实和“年轻人“没有多大关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fd8bd9b8-73be-50e8-ab0b-671b55e035a6", "source_ordinal": 2732, "reading_ordinal": 1321, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "关心军事", "published_at": "2022-06-22T00:21:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/503875313/answer/2539039449"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不知兵，则不知军；", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不知军，则不知政；", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不知政，则不知经；", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不知经，则不知运。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "很多根本的政策问题都和——什么时候会打 / 能不能赢 / 会怎么打 / 会有什么得失——有极大关系。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "打得赢和打不赢，政策的走向会有方向性的不同。会怎么打，会极大的影响产业布局甚至城市定位。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这些东西是影响经济局势、进而是影响人生计划的最根本的因素，只是经过了多重稳定器和缓冲机制，对你进行了重重掩饰罢了。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "quote", "index": 8, "text": "兵者，国之大事，死生之地，存亡之道，不可不察也。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "很多人误以为这话是对皇帝或者元帅说的。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 238}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "殊不知，这其实是对每一个读者说的。", "char_start": 239, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你要留学、你要投资、你要择居、你要择业，如果你不懂军事、不识基本的胜负，你常会犯方向性的错误——筋疲力竭的向上游划水。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "多少努力，都被你毫无察觉的大势抵消了。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 336}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "甚至更惨——一夜之间，化为乌有。", "char_start": 337, "char_end": 353}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "甚至更惨——不幸在错误的时间、错误的地方，你越“成功”，你越该死。", "char_start": 354, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这跟军事爱好者们的喜爱不是一回事。军事爱好者往往热衷于炫耀知识、人前争胜。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 425}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你要真正的关心，关心到能下自己将来不会悔恨的赌注为止。不限男女、不拘贵贱，都是如此。", "char_start": 426, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为这些问题关系到你的真金白银、关系到你的饭碗，是实实在在的死生之地、存亡之道。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "直接关系到钱，你说要不要关心？", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 525}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17, "quote": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么要鼓励大家关注军事？军事爱好者对于国家和社会的作用是什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“关心军事”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不知兵，则不知军；”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不知兵，则不知军；", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a68a01bc-2422-5423-83d9-3b55945366da", "source_ordinal": 2731, "reading_ordinal": 1322, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "冷漠否", "published_at": "2022-06-22T08:06:44+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/538025581/answer/2539194102"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这事有一个绝妙的悖论。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果一个人责怪别人不肯放下自己的生计来帮补ta的生计——也就是冷漠最通俗的定义，", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那么这个人自己倒是挺冷漠。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "Poetic irony, don’t you think?", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 97}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 4}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：现在的中国社会到底有多冷漠？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“冷漠否”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这事有一个绝妙的悖论。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这事有一个绝妙的悖论。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "77ca1624-6031-5dd3-90fe-bc5809d7f9a0", "source_ordinal": 2730, "reading_ordinal": 1323, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "下水救生", "published_at": "2022-06-22T13:23:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/538775474/answer/2539665977"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "在更深层面上如何诠释农夫与蛇的故事？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不具名的“知情人”的论述，暂时不宜作为依据做什么评论。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "只单说下水救人这事——", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "以后应该推广一个常识：会游泳和会救生不是一回事。救生是一项专业技能，需要专门的训练才行。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 102}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不建议仅仅因为会游泳就无防护的贸然下水实施救援。", "char_start": 103, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果一定要在这种前提下实施救援，那么要尽量寻找辅助手段增加安全系数。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "例如腰上系绳， 或者找到什么临时漂浮物——例如空饮料瓶——固定在身上，或者采用不下水的救援方式为好。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "施救者的生命不比求救者的生命便宜，保证自身的安全是首位的。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "用塑料瓶制作救生衣", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 253}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 2}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_has_content_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "body", "char_start": 0, "sample": "在更深层面上如何诠释农夫与蛇的故事？"}, {"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 244, "sample": "用塑料瓶制作救生衣"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：16 岁男孩疑被 2 名女生误导下河救人溺亡，事件后续进展如何？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“下水救生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“在更深层面上如何诠释农夫与蛇的故事？不具名的“知情人”的论述，暂时不宜作为依据做什么评论。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 2, "quote": "不具名的“知情人”的论述，暂时不宜作为依据做什么评论。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 45, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a849e6cb-7115-5915-94f6-4641a1b6ff68", "source_ordinal": 2729, "reading_ordinal": 1324, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "十八岁", "published_at": "2022-06-22T15:53:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/418878039/answer/2539879826"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这说的是“没有义务做”，不是在说“不会再做”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "意思是再做就不算是义务范围之内理所当然了的，不是欠你的、该你的了。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 57}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "欠你、该你的已经给足了，做到了。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你再开口要什么，可以开口再要，", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但是若要不到，你不能再怨了。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果要到了，你要说谢谢了。", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而且要记账，至少做出要还的准备了。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不必惊慌，他多半是怕你断不了奶。真完全不管，一般的父母其实想做都不见得能做到。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "其实十八以后建立独立的财务意识是很重要的人生关口。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一个没有自负盈亏的意识，并且把父母当成提款机、社保账户来看的人，往往对风险没有足够的敬畏，因而也不会真正的学会严谨和努力。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其实努力的主要动力就是怕捅娄子。而怕捅娄子的主要原因就是全得自己买单而自己又穷。怕着怕着，问题就问全了、问到点子上了，工作就做细致了，说话办事就靠谱了，别人也就信赖了。", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "人的地位感也就来了，别人的尊重也就来了。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "也就性感起来了——因为这就是可以托付、值得争取的人了。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 400}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "独立负责的人跟不能独立负责的人的气味是不同的。说得不好听点——在江湖上后者根本就不算是个人，只是父母的一块息肉。", "char_start": 401, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这不是坏事，是好事，你是会害怕，会恐慌，但忍住了这个害怕和惊慌，不但不咒骂，而是能对之前十八年的照顾表示感谢的话，", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你已经是一条及格的好汉，你的人生立刻就开了个好头。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "啥好头？", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "记住下面这些话——", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 558}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不要养成用“现场跟人争论该与不该”来解决问题的习惯。", "char_start": 559, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "现场跟人争论该与不该，基本上总是荒谬的。", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "该与不该是立法问题。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "现场即丛林，实力决定立法权。对方实力占优，没有开放立法讨论的打算，而是打算用实力执行自己的法。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 665}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你要谈该与不该，去找拥有更高一级裁决权的人谈——比如去跟出警的民警谈、去跟主管谈、去跟法官谈，不要跟对方谈。", "char_start": 666, "char_end": 720}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你在丛林里发现一匹马追着你咬，你要跟它谈“你应该吃草”，“你应该温顺”，你属于没活醒。", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这跟你爹的十八不养论有什么关系？", "char_start": 766, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你不服，去跟律师、检察官、法官讨论应该不应该，不要跟你爹谈。", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你在他面前，你希望他接着供应你，你要去做会导致他乐于继续供应你的事。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 848}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "跟他争论“该不该”，绝对不属于这种事。", "char_start": 849, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "马咬你，你要么跑，要么躲，要么抓把草塞它嘴，要么抓根棍打，都可以，就是不要跟它争。", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你爹要十八不养，你跟他争“不该”，只会让他更笃定——这种自私白眼狼养来吃人吗？", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 950}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你跟他说感谢十八年照顾，以后你养我都算我借的，比怒斥哀怨强一亿亿亿倍——因为后者是负值，前者好歹是正值。", "char_start": 951, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "现场即丛林，丛林只认行动有效的好汉，不认“律师”。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1029}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "搞不清这点，活该单身狗。", "char_start": 1030, "char_end": 1042}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0209"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我的爸爸重复告诉我一句话「你已经十八岁，我的义务已完成，我没必要再为你做什么」请问你怎么看？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033"], "summary": "围绕“十八岁”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这说的是“没有义务做”，不是在说“不会再做”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这说的是“没有义务做”，不是在说“不会再做”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
